    {
      "id": "5",
      "subevent": "Randy Walden, Air Force Rapid Capabilities Office director, stated that the X-37B completed its longest flight to date and successfully completed all mission objectives, including hosting Air Force Research Laboratory experiments and providing a ride for small satellites."
